.TH ferry-language 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-language \- Show or change the interface language (`en`, `pl`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry language\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICODE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or change the interface language (`en`, `pl`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fICODE\fR]
Language code to save
